Package: dot-os-grub-theme
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, grub-common
Description: bootloader menu theme for DOT OS
 A GRUB theme in the DOT OS style: wordmark, an inverted selection bar
 and a segmented countdown on black. Sets itself as the GRUB theme.
